    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds okay, but I'm a bit worried about the 2018 one (US Patent 10,555,888). When I was skimming it, it seemed pretty close to the client's setup—it also mentioned an array of micro-actuators for tactile pressure. \n\nAre you sure about that distinction you made? Give me a more granular breakdown of how we can differentiate our client's tech from that 2018 patent specifically so the examiner doesn't just cite it and reject our application.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
